FVXBM.\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"text\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"inbox\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KJ63QDZSHSB8J8BAEEPV4EZQ\",\n      \"title\": \"Agents should check plan_ref when starting tasks. If a task has plan_ref, run kspec plan get @plan-ref to read implementation notes, algorithm details, and context. Update task-work skill and task-work-loop workflow to include this step. Plans are the right place for rich implementation context instead of cramming it into task notes.\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"text\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"inbox\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KJCXMR524W6YTGCEPHEZ97WH\",\n      \"title\": \"kspec task patch appears to hang indefinitely — had to kill and use task set + task note as workaround\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"text\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"inbox\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KJGAE24345STWVS3RMKNC838\",\n      \"title\": \"task set --description: task set has no --description option, making it impossible to update task descriptions after creation. Workaround: add detailed task notes. Came up when plan-derived task had null description and needed standalone context for automation.\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"text\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"observation\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KF94FMF9Y5VCS7EQXP4G2FRJ\",\n      \"title\": \"Session/workflow patterns: Spike tasks with no code output don't need commits - value is in task notes documenting research. Shadow-only changes (task state updates) don't need main-branch PRs since shadow branch is source of truth. PR skill correctly detects no changes and exits cleanly for metadata-only tasks. PR workflow smooth with auto-generated branch names and /pr skill. Shadow CLI verification iteration showed pattern: pick task, verify implementation exists, complete task, no code changes needed.\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"content\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"observation\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KF94HDYHTGCMZCC6MMFYJGNJ\",\n      \"title\": \"Spike workflow refinement: When completing spike, capture recommendation in closed_reason (brief) + final note (detailed). Spike task notes form mini research doc. Pattern: findings → analysis → recommendation. Example: task-archive spike documented current system, reviewed references, recommended MVP approach all in notes.\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"content\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 73,\n  \"showing\": 50\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":783428353},"formatted_output":"{\n  \"pattern\": \"task note\",\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"item\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KHYRCWD9CNW9FSGPFNH3NK2Y\",\n      \"title\": \"Needs Work State\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"acceptance_criteria[6].then\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"item\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KEZCJPJ4A4QG2DY5F3BBVFVB\",\n      \"title\": \"Task Notes\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"title\",\n        \"acceptance_criteria[0].when\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"item\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KEZCJPJ4Y0CGNFZREY3QS225\",\n      \"title\": \"Note CLI Commands\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"description\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"item\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KFBVD707HVYZZ240A0KMEZ3N\",\n      \"title\": \"Task Automation Eligibility\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"acceptance_criteria[17].then\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"item\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KFGF8XEDNW7Q9RTR1Z47ATRM\",\n      \"title\": \"Clear Task Dependencies\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"acceptance_criteria[0].then\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"item\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KGR05MEAH53X163Q1FAW8Y9Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Batch Command Schema\",\n      \"matchedFields\": [\n        \"acceptance_criteria[0].then\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"item\",\n      \"ulid\": \"01KF24J46CY5Y7MPN1P